# Terraform working files and state
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log
**/terraform.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars

# Credentials and environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
**/kubeconfig*

# Local environments
.venv/
__pycache__/
.DS_Store

# Preserve generated provider locks in Git
!.terraform.lock.hcl
